    "intro_narrative": "Welcome to Neo-Veridian, Sector 7. You are a rogue data-runner trapped in a highly secured corporate black-site. Your latest heist went completely wrong, and the facility's lockdown protocols have engaged. The only way out is to manually breach the central AI's mainframe and open the blast doors. The facility is scattered with decommissioned tech, encrypted caches, and gruesome leftovers from previous runners who didn't make it. You will need to carefully analyze the environment, recover forgotten biometric data, and daisy-chain these fragmented systems together. Your ultimate goal is to navigate this digital and physical maze, synthesize the required bypass codes, and execute the final system override before the automated security sweep permanently erases you from the grid. Every node is connected; find the path and break the system.",
    "narrative_style": "cyberpunk"
